teria for them to accept Like for example you hear about Socrates, Plato and Aristotle said..", "Socrates said, Plato said.. And none of this can be established that it is from them or it is from their time Or any of that, or Alexander the Great did this or he didn't do that.. So you find those people, or many of the people, pretend this history is accurate and accept this history They never question this history when someone tells them Aristotle said or Plato said or this person said or that person said And they want to question Hadith, and they don't even understand how much scrutiny does it take for Muslims To say this specific Hadith is Authentic or this specific Hadith is Weak!", "Which is a complete double standard and hypocrisy when it comes to looking at the historicity of something So essentially if you reject Hadith, you have to reject all history. Western history and non-Western history, Because you're not going to find anything or anyone that goes into depth and so much scrutiny As Muslims do when it comes to the Hadith, and if you don't believe me, that's what we are about to demonstrate right now, And then you can look at us demonstrating that, come to your own conclusion.. Does anyone in the world go to such scrutiny to determine whether something is accurate or not accurate?",))
