f worship. It's not appropriate for us to do something like this in a house of God, a place of worship. Then the Prophet– does it end there? Imagine the mercy. If you talk about mercy and compassion– if this clip reaches you, Mr. Terence, Then this should be the reason for you to come back to Islam. If that was the reason, truly, if the story is true, then this should be the reason that you come back to Islam.", "Because you want to believe in a Merciful God in a story like this. Your exact story here. Here's a Prophet of God telling us how to behave. Story doesn't end there where the Prophet just tells him that and lets him go. Then the Prophet turns around and he speaks to the Sahaba, the Companions. And he said to them, we were sent from God -or God commanded us- مُيَسِّرين As people who are lenient, people who are easy, people who are merciful Not مُعَسِّرين, not people who are of difficulty. Not people who bring about hardship to other people.", "Mind-blowing! Many Muslims heard this story, because we know the character of the Prophetﷺ Not what people keep character assassinating the Prophetﷺ with lies And fabricated stories and fairy tales. These are real life events. This is what Muslims are being taught how to behave. So even if this story, fairy tale story was true, all of these Muslims went against the action of the Prophetﷺ When they have an actual precedent of how to behave, and they have a clear teaching of the Prophet that we are sent easy and lenient to the people! So how can I blame God and say that \"I believe in a Merciful God\"?", "When these people literally have in their own tradition, the Prophet teaching us what to do, In the exact same situation if this were to happen in real life. It's insane!",))
